          194,
          80,
          145,
          955,
          335
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $\\Omega$ be an open set in $\\mathbb{R}^m$ and let $C_b^k(\\overline\\Omega)$ be the set of all functions on $\\overline\\Omega$ which have continuous bounded derivatives up to order $k$. Define\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:bounded-continuous-derivatives-sum-norm}\n\\|u\\|=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq k}\\sup_{\\bm{x}\\in\\overline\\Omega}|D^\\alpha u(\\bm{x})|.\n\\end{equation}\nShow that $C_b^k(\\overline\\Omega)$ is a Banach space.",
      "zh": "设 $\\Omega$ 为 $\\mathbb{R}^m$ 中的开集, 用 $C_b^k(\\overline\\Omega)$ 表示 $\\overline\\Omega$ 上所有直到 $k$ 阶导数都连续且有界的函数的集合. 定义\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:bounded-continuous-derivatives-sum-norm}\n\\|u\\|=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq k}\\sup_{\\bm{x}\\in\\overline\\Omega}|D^\\alpha u(\\bm{x})|.\n\\end{equation}\n证明 $C_b^k(\\overline\\Omega)$ 是 Banach 空间.",
      "label": "ex:bounded-continuous-derivatives-banach",
